PE 851: SOP and POS / 除数对的积与和

=== Problem Interpretation ===
For n > 1, D(n) = set of divisors of n.
SOP(n) = Σ_{a<b} a×b  (sum of products)
POS(n) = Π_{a<b} (a+b) (product of sums)

