=== Examples of SOP Computation ===
n = 6
  σ₁(n) = 12
  σ₂(n) = 50
  SOP(n) = (12² - 50) / 2 = 47
  Divisor pairs: 6
n = 12
  σ₁(n) = 28
  σ₂(n) = 210
  SOP(n) = (28² - 210) / 2 = 287
  Divisor pairs: 15
n = 28
  σ₁(n) = 56
  σ₂(n) = 1050
  SOP(n) = (56² - 1050) / 2 = 1043
  Divisor pairs: 15
n = 30
  σ₁(n) = 72
  σ₂(n) = 1300
  SOP(n) = (72² - 1300) / 2 = 1942
  Divisor pairs: 28
n = 60
  σ₁(n) = 168
  σ₂(n) = 5460
  SOP(n) = (168² - 5460) / 2 = 11382
  Divisor pairs: 66

=== Cumulative SOP ===
Σ_{n=2}^{100} SOP(n) = 301155

